    "summary": "The user informs the assistant that the board is replacing its heavy-compute model with a decentralized, rule-based system to save costs. The assistant responds by asking clarifying questions about the transition and personnel, ultimately expressing a need to \"brace itself\" while offering cautionary advice about the complexities of the upcoming migration.",
